 "title": "Glossary and reading list",
 "excerpt": "Every Arabic, Hebrew and technical term used on this site in plain words, and a reading list of the scholarship behind it, both searchable and filterable.",
 "status": "publish",
 "content": "<!-- wp:columns {\"align\":\"wide\",\"className\":\"article-grid\"} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-columns alignwide article-grid\"><!-- wp:column {\"width\":\"64%\"} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-column\" style=\"flex-basis:64%\"><!-- wp:paragraph {\"className\":\"is-style-lead\"} -->\n<p class=\"is-style-lead\">Terms in Arabic and in the study of manuscripts recur throughout this site. This glossary gives each one in a line, with the Arabic where there is one. Below it is a reading list of the books and articles on which the site draws, with a note on what each is good for.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Type in the box to search, or pick a category.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"anchor\":\"glossary\"} -->\n<h2 id=\"glossary\" class=\"wp-block-heading\">Glossary</h2>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:shortcode -->\n[islamicdilemma_glossary]\n<!-- /wp:shortcode -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"anchor\":\"reading\"} -->\n<h2 id=\"reading\" class=\"wp-block-heading\">Reading list</h2>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>The works below are the ones this site relies on most. They are listed with a note on what each is for; the fuller annotated bibliography, with links to online sources, is on <a href=\"{{home_url}}/resources/\">Sources and scholarship</a>.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:shortcode -->\n[islamicdilemma_reading_list]\n<!-- /wp:shortcode --></div>\n<!-- /wp:column -->\n\n<!-- wp:column {\"width\":\"36%\"} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-column\" style=\"flex-basis:36%\"><!-- wp:group {\"className\":\"sidebar\",\"layout\":{\"type\":\"default\"}} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-group sidebar\"><!-- wp:shortcode -->\n[islamicdilemma_toc]\n<!-- /wp:shortcode -->\n\n<!-- wp:group {\"className\":\"is-style-side-box\",\"layout\":{\"type\":\"default\"}} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-group is-style-side-box\"><!-- wp:heading {\"className\":\"side-title\"} -->\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading side-title\">Margin notes</h2>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph {\"className\":\"gloss\"} -->\n<p class=\"gloss\"><strong>Use</strong> Type a word, or choose a category to narrow the list.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph {\"className\":\"gloss\"} -->\n<p class=\"gloss\">Missing a term? Ask through the <a href=\"{{home_url}}/contact/\">contact form</a>.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph --></div>\n<!-- /wp:group -->\n\n<!-- wp:group {\"className\":\"is-style-side-box\",\"layout\":{\"type\":\"default\"}} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-group is-style-side-box\"><!-- wp:heading {\"className\":\"side-title\"} -->\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading side-title\">Read next</h2>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph {\"className\":\"gloss\"} -->\n<p class=\"gloss\"><a href=\"{{home_url}}/resources/\">Sources and scholarship</a></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph {\"className\":\"gloss\"} -->\n<p class=\"gloss\"><a href=\"{{home_url}}/faq/\">Frequently asked questions</a></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph --></div>\n<!-- /wp:group --></div>\n<!-- /wp:group --></div>\n<!-- /wp:column --></div>\n<!-- /wp:columns -->",
